Package: tobixu-desktop-xfce
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Manuel Lopez Mateos <mlmateos@tobixu.xyz>
Installed-Size: 7
Depends: xfce4, lightdm, xfce4-goodies, tobixu-wallpapers, tobixu-keyboard, texstudio, texlive-base, frescobaldi, lilypond, libreoffice
Recommends: tobi-xu-stem, tobi-xu-arts, tobixu-desktop-plasma, tobixu-desktop-lxqt
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Description: TobiXu XFCE desktop (slim rolling release)
 XFCE 4 con identidad TobiXu (wallpapers, teclados)
 más aplicaciones base (Texstudio, Frescobaldi, Lilypond, LibreOffice).
 .
 Para instalar STEM completo: apt install tobi-xu-stem
 Para instalar ARTS completo: apt install tobi-xu-arts
 Para instalar Plasma como alternativa: apt install tobixu-desktop-plasma
 Para instalar LXQt como alternativa: apt install tobixu-desktop-lxqt
